        "in: the floor plan, a section, a worksheet, a layout or a master layout. Works for 2D elements (Line, "
        "PolyLine, Arc, Hatch, Text, Label, Dimension, Drawing ...) as well as for model elements; a Text's box covers "
        "its drawn lines, a Drawing's box its frame with the title. The current window does not need to show the "
