        "material, the area of the cut surface and its polygons (outline and holes) in 2D coordinates of the plane. "
        "From Archicad 28 the 3D model is generated with separate components in a temporary sight, so a composite "
        "structure has one body per skin and the 3D window is not changed. Before Archicad 28 the bodies are those of "
