        "transformation matrix, its inverse, and the origin and axes in world coordinates derived from the inverse. "
        "For Windows, Doors and Skylights the local-to-global matrix is the one Archicad returns, and mirrored ones "
        "give a left-handed matrix (isMirrored). For Opening elements it is built from the opening geometry (Archicad "
        "29 and later): origin at the anchor point, the X and Y axes of the opening and Z = X \u00d7 Y, which points "
        "against the extrusion direction. Needs Archicad 27 or later."
